      "statement": "The account-wide Bedrock budget (aws_budgets_budget.bedrock) is a cost-visibility-only singleton whose Service cost filter covers all Bedrock charges in the AWS account/region, not only charges from ROSA Boundary, and its 50/80/100% threshold notifications never throttle or stop inference.",
