    {
      "id": "claim_c237f90c54e944e6aa4272ab131dbf25",
      "statement": "role_name_prefix (account) must equal account_role_name_prefix (regional) across every consuming region, since regional Terraform resolves shared role names by string concatenation rather than remote-state reference; legacy_policy_region designates exactly one region that keeps unsuffixed inline policy names while every other region appends -${aws_region}; and the aggregate inline-policy size on each shared role is capped at AWS's 10,240-character-per-role quota, which region-qualified naming avoids collisions for but does not raise.",
