      "statement": "Plain Terraform moved blocks are not usable for this cross-state ownership transfer because they only operate within a single state; the removed-then-import pair is the supported mechanism, and if multiple existing regional states already share one of these objects it must be released from every one of those states before being imported once into account state, since two states must never manage the same object.",
